          {
            "question": "Do the prices include VAT?",
            "answer": "No. All amounts on this page are excl. VAT and apply for 2026."
          },
          {
            "question": "Which subscription suits us?",
            "answer": "Most employers choose Pay per service: a low fixed fee and paying per service. If you want to know exactly where you stand in advance, choose Complete case management. Larger organisations receive a tailored proposal. We are happy to work it out with you."
          },
          {
            "question": "What does per quarter hour started mean?",
            "answer": "A ten-minute phone call counts as one quarter hour; a twenty-minute conversation counts as two."
          },
          {
            "question": "How quickly do I get a tailored quote?",
            "answer": "Within two working days after we have discussed your question."
          }
